=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to {n:Tosuka-Porika} to begin the quest. You will be told to speak to {n:Furakku-Norakku} for further details. {n:Furakku-Norakku} will give you the {@k} {k:Overdue book notification|Overdue book notification (Art)} to be delivered to {n:Orn}.
** {n:Orn} is located at F-10 in the Rarab Tail Hostelry room above the Timbre Timbers Tavern.
** (Optional) You can speak to {n:Furakku-Norakku} again at {n:Orn}'s request.
* You will have to go to {z:Giddeus} and talk to {n:Quu Bokye}, then trade a {i:Silver Beastcoin|Silver Beastcoin|750}. You will receive {@k} {k:"Art For Everyone"}.
** Quu Bokye is in the Treasure Room, which can be found in the underground map of Giddeus. It is the northwest room at the end of a U-turn on the map.
** (Optional) You can speak to {n:Orn} again with the book.
* Speak to {n:Furakku-Norakku} with the key item to complete the quest.

